<title>UK: BOE allots 285 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 285 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 285 million stg of assistance in its noon operations.</p>
<p>It allotted 85 million stg in bills outright and 200 million stg in 6.0 percent repos to May 7, 8 and 9.</p>
